{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（1日）凌晨1時許，警方接獲報案，一名年約60歲男子進入深水埗基隆街220至222號後巷，懷疑偷取財物，父子見狀上前阻止，父親和男賊均受輕傷送院，警員到場調查，案件列作「盜竊」和「襲擊致造成身體傷害」。</p><p>就現場所見，警員封鎖後巷調查。據了解，涉案被捕男子懷疑有不良嗜好。</p><figure><img alt=\"警員封鎖後巷調查。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261001/1182175361698500608073984.jpeg/EtPThlsVU3gavSgqbDdQu9XiCa_Y8ubboA8aw5oPGsM\"/><figcaption>警員封鎖後巷調查。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員封鎖後巷調查。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261001/1182175364760473600921804.jpeg/0IK5Qscq1EAQidGXPzs5Wo5dCoFajuSTq2eSR5Fnkkc\"/><figcaption>警員封鎖後巷調查。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是深水埗基隆街220至222號。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261001/1182175367465930752652879.jpeg/B-eOrueZoblGZcWisw7KG7UeRvn0DKEBR93FQn3dxUI\"/><figcaption>現場是深水埗基隆街220至222號。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員到場調查。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261001/1182175358598778880582374.jpeg/Pc813kkhG6lyCtysEdeHEdDEMi8stMlACBI30jISN9I\"/><figcaption>警員到場調查。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-30T21:39:21.343915+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":184,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}